     "<div css=\x22" "font-text-caption-minor-beige\x22" ">Bow</div><div css=\x22" "font-text-caption-minor-white\x22" ">Attack 11</div><br/>An ornate bow used by the self-proclaimed \x22" "Masked Liberators.\x22" " Flashy in appearance and formidable in performance, it draws smoothly and maintains its power even in sandstorms. Contrary to their talk of salvation, in practice it's used to raid villages and butcher people.", // Crimson Desert chest 12
