     "<div css=\x22" "font-text-caption-minor-beige\x22" ">Sword</div><div css=\x22" "font-text-caption-minor-white\x22" ">Attack 10</div><div css=\x22" "font-text-caption-minor-white\x22" ">Critical Rate Lv 1</div><br/>A mysterious curved sword imbued with a radiant golden glow. Much like the history of the Crimson Desert, shrouded in mystery to outsiders, this weapon is equally enigmatic. Its ornate patterns and bizarre embellishments suggest the blade was forged for ritualistic purposes.", // Acria Sword
